===== Did selection transfer? =====
Rank correlation between what the search maximized (train fitness) and what
the holdout delivered, across the 19 tuned family champions.

  all families:        rho = 0.225, permutation p = 0.354   <- no evidence of transfer
  better half only:    rho = -0.033, permutation p = 0.950   <- no evidence of transfer

  Read the second line, not the first. A search that only knows which ideas
  are hopeless will score well on the first line while being useless for the
  decision anybody actually makes, which is choosing among the good ones.

  On the holdout, the coin-flip control ranked 4 of 20 family champions.

